---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/site/Header.astro";
import FloatingFooter from "../components/site/FloatingFooter.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="Terms of Service — Comet Client" description="Comet Client Terms of Service.">
  <Header />
  <main class="flex min-h-screen flex-col">
    <div class="hero-concept hero-concept--short relative h-64 sm:h-72">
      <div class="hero-concept__bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="relative z-[1] flex h-full items-end">
        <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 pb-10 sm:px-6">
          <p class="font-pixel text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] text-white/40">Legal &amp; Terms</p>
          <h1 class="font-pixel mt-2 text-4xl text-gradient-gold sm:text-5xl">Terms of Service</h1>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <article class="page-body legal-prose mx-auto max-w-3xl flex-1 px-4 py-14 sm:px-6">
      <p>Last updated: July 6, 2026. By using Comet Client you agree to the following terms. We reserve the right to update these terms at any time without notifying you.</p>

      <h2>1. Use of service</h2>
      <p>
        Comet Client is provided free of charge for personal use. You may not redistribute,
        decompile, or commercially resell the software. You may not use the software for any illegal activities or to exploit any bugs or vulnerabilities in the software.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Minecraft account</h2>
      <p>
        You must own a valid Minecraft Java Edition account. Comet does not store your Microsoft password. You are responsible for the security of your account and the data associated with it.
      </p>

      <h2>3. User content</h2>
      <p>
        You retain ownership of any content created with Comet. By using cosmetics or skins,
        you grant us a license to display them in-game. You are responsible for the actions you take with our cosmetics and we do not take any responsibility of misuse.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Termination</h2>
      <p>We may temporarily or permanently block accounts that violate fair-play or community guidelines. We reserve the right to terminate your account if you are found to be in violation of these terms. We will not block your hardware address or IP address, but rather the UUID associated with your account.</p>

      <h2>5. Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>Comet is not affiliated with Mojang or Microsoft. Minecraft is a trademark of Mojang AB. We do not take any responsibility for any data loss or corruption that may occur as a result of using our software.</p>
    </article>

    <FloatingFooter />
  </main>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .legal-prose :global(h2) {
    font-family: 'MultiTypePixel', 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: hsl(0 0% 100% / 0.9);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .legal-prose :global(p) {
    color: hsl(0 0% 100% / 0.55);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
</style>
